    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Galvin Property are delighted to present 11 The Millhouse to the open market for sale. No.11 is a stunning three bedroom apartment located on the 2nd floor of this highly sought after city centre development. The Steelworks is a modern development situated right in the heart of the city centre with a wealth of amenities on the doorstep including Connolly Station and the IFSC.\r\n\r\nThe bright and spacious apartment extends approx. 90sqm/970sq.ft. The accommodation comprises: entrance hallway, large storage space, open plan kitchen/living/dining room with floor to ceiling windows and balcony access, three double bedrooms (main with ensuite) and a family bathroom to complete the accommodation. \r\n\r\nMany of Dublin's principal places of business are also within easy reach of the apartment including O'Connell Street, IFSC, Trinity College and Grafton Street. This area could not be more convenient regarding all forms of public transport. The LUAS, DAFT and many bus routes are all within walking distance.\r\n\r\nAvailable to view now."
      },
      {
